   "text": "Western International College - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nWestern International College\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nAt Western International College, your journey begins with more than just a pathway to a professional master’s or undergraduate degree – it’s the start of a transformative academic and personal experience.  \nHere, you’ll find a supportive community, exceptional programming and a student-centred approach designed to prepare you for success at Western University – and far beyond. Whether in the classroom, through student life, or in your everyday experiences, Western International College is where you’ll build the confidence and skills to thrive in your studies and shape your future.  \nWith access to outstanding faculty, innovative learning and a vibrant, inclusive environment, Western International College empowers international students to reach their full potential—academically, personally and professionally. \nTimestamps\nUpdated\n05/05/2026 06:27\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n10/04/2026 06:29\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nCanada\nYearly Fees\nMax: CA$50,016.00\nMin: CA$47,493.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n24%\n1,200 of 5,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPrivate\nProvider\nNAVITAS\nFounded Year\n1878\nCampus(es)\nLondon\nCountry\nCanada\nExcluded Countries\nAustralia, Cuba, Iran, North Korea, Syria, United States\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n27/03/2026\nContract End Date\n01/04/2029\nContract Entity\nQS Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\n-\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JSIvnhoOzV0\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
